<title>PAKISTAN: HOCKEY-GOLDEN JUBILEE RESULTS. [CORRECTED 14:56 GMT]</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-GOLDEN JUBILEE RESULTS. [CORRECTED 14:56 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the third day of the</p>
<p>Golden Jubilee of Pakistan men's hockey tournament on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Germany beat Australia 2-1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Germany - Oliver Domke 22, Christoph Bechmann 70</p>
<p>Australia - James Elmer 65</p>
<p>Pakistan 3  Netherlands  3 (halftime 2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Pakistan - Muhammad Shahbaz (junior) 5, 48, Tahir Zaman 9</p>
<p>(penalty stroke)</p>
<p>Netherlands - Bram Lomans 4, 41 Jaap Buma 65</p>
<p>(Corrects name of third scorer.)</p>
</text>
